// BEGIN GENERATED ARM64 ACROSS_ENTRY TABLE (cmd/arm64tblgen) — do not edit by hand.
// arm64_across_entry: the across-lanes table. The size-mask slot carries the
// WIDENING flag — saddlv/uaddlv produce a result one element size up, so
// their scalar destination is a class wider than the arrangement.
